@startuml
title Deployment Diagram - AI-Based Customer Support Automation System

' ======================
' Nodes (physical / logical)
' ======================

node "Client Machine\n(Web Browser)" as ClientNode {
  artifact "Web Frontend\n(HTML/CSS/JS)" as FrontendArtifact
}

node "Application Server\n(Spring Boot)" as AppServer {
  artifact "AI-Based Customer Support\nBackend Application\n(.jar / .war)" as BackendArtifact
}

node "Database Server\nRDBMS (MySQL/H2)" as DBServer {
  database "Support Database" as SupportDB
}

node "External AI Service\n(OpenAI / Gemini API)" as AISvcNode {
  artifact "AI NLP/Sentiment\nCloud Service" as AISvcArtifact
}

' ======================
' Connections
' ======================

' Client browser to backend over HTTP/HTTPS
ClientNode --> AppServer : HTTP/HTTPS\nREST API calls\n(/api/auth, /api/chat,\n/api/tickets, /api/analytics)

' Backend to database via JDBC/JPA
AppServer --> DBServer : JDBC/JPA\n(read/write users,\n tickets, messages,\n knowledge base)

' Backend to external AI service via HTTPS
AppServer --> AISvcNode : HTTPS\nAPI calls for NLP,\n sentiment, response generation

' ======================
' Deployment details (notes)
' ======================

note right of FrontendArtifact
  - Deployed as static web pages
  - Technologies: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
  - Runs in client browser
end note

note right of BackendArtifact
  - Java Spring Boot application
  - Exposes REST APIs:
    * /api/auth (login/register)
    * /api/chat (chatbot interaction)
    * /api/tickets (ticket management)
    * /api/agent/tickets (agent operations)
    * /api/kb (knowledge base)
    * /api/analytics (dashboard data)
  - Implements business logic for:
    * Ticket lifecycle
    * Sentiment & confidence
    * Escalation rules
end note

note right of SupportDB
  - Tables:
    * User
    * Ticket
    * Message
    * KnowledgeBaseEntry
    * SystemLog
  - Stores persistent data:
    * Accounts & roles
    * Tickets & conversations
    * Knowledge base
    * Logs for monitoring
end note

note right of AISvcArtifact
  - Provides AI capabilities:
    * Natural Language Processing (NLP)
    * Sentiment Analysis
    * Response generation
  - Accessed via API keys and HTTPS
end note

@enduml
